{"title": "Three reads, thirty seconds", "type": "Speed cheat sheet", "hooks": ["Three chart reads in thirty seconds. Miss one and you're guessing.", "Trend, candle, pattern. Three real charts, thirty seconds.", "Most beginners read one of these wrong. Three charts, fast."], "scenes": [{"kind": "hook", "vo": "Most beginners read one of these wrong. Three charts, fast.", "text": "3 reads. 30 seconds.", "chart": 0, "win": [19, 114], "show": 89}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "One: the downtrend", "show": 62, "vo": "One. GeneSpring, hourly. Each high is lower than the last, and each low is lower too. That's a downtrend.", "cues": [{"say": "Each high", "do": "mark", "i": 60, "label": "A", "side": "high", "tone": "amber"}, {"say": "lower than the last", "do": "reveal", "to": 89}, {"say": "each low is lower too", "do": "mark", "i": 88, "label": "B", "side": "low", "tone": "red"}], "win": [19, 114]}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 1, "head": "Two: the hammer", "vo": "Two. A hammer. A long lower wick, at least twice the body. Sellers pushed it down, buyers pushed it back.", "cues": [{"say": "A hammer", "do": "mark", "i": 90, "label": "H", "side": "low", "tone": "teal"}], "win": [20, 102], "show": 90}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 1, "head": "Only a clue", "show": 90, "vo": "But it's only a clue. Ten candles later, this one was down 3.9 percent.", "cues": [{"say": "Ten candles later", "do": "reveal", "to": 100}], "win": [20, 102]}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 2, "head": "Three: rising wedge", "vo": "Three. Chronos Labs drew a rising wedge, which points down. It's only complete when a close breaks the trigger.", "cues": [{"say": "rising wedge", "do": "zoom", "from": 45, "to": 90}, {"say": "the trigger", "do": "line", "price": 184.9, "label": "Trigger", "tone": "amber"}], "win": [20, 115], "show": 90}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 2, "head": "It never broke", "show": 90, "vo": "This one never broke down. Price closed past the other side first, so the idea was wrong.", "cues": [